.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH QUIPU-SEARCH 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-search \- Search entities by keyword, vector or hybrid ranking
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu search\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-\-mode\fR] [\fB\-\-limit\fR] [\fB\-\-alpha\fR] [\fB\-\-rrf\-k\fR] [\fB\-\-decay\fR] [\fB\-\-anchor\fR] [\fB\-\-anchor\-mode\fR] [\fB\-\-direction\fR] [\fB\-\-max\-hops\fR] [\fB\-\-via\fR] [\fB\-\-fusion\fR] [\fB\-\-valid\-at\fR] [\fB\-\-type\fR] [\fB\-\-group\fR] [\fB\-\-structured\-query\fR] [\fB\-\-filters\fR] [\fB\-\-graph\fR] [\fB\-\-graphs\fR] [\fB\-\-explain\fR] [\fB\-\-all\-graphs\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIquery\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Search entities by keyword, vector or hybrid ranking
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-\-mode\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Operation mode
.TP
\fB\-\-limit\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Maximum number of results
.TP
\fB\-\-alpha\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Hybrid search semantic/keyword weighting
.TP
\fB\-\-rrf\-k\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Reciprocal\-rank fusion constant
.TP
\fB\-\-decay\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Search recency decay factor
.TP
\fB\-\-anchor\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Entity IRI anchoring graph\-aware search
.TP
\fB\-\-anchor\-mode\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
How the anchor affects candidate selection
.TP
\fB\-\-direction\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Traversal direction for graph\-aware search
.TP
\fB\-\-max\-hops\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Maximum graph\-search traversal hops
.TP
\fB\-\-via\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Predicate or path used for traversal
.TP
\fB\-\-fusion\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Search result fusion strategy
.TP
\fB\-\-valid\-at\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Valid\-time instant to query
.TP
\fB\-\-type\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Entity type IRI to select
.TP
\fB\-\-group\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Group identifier for the operation
.TP
\fB\-\-structured\-query\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Structured search query as JSON
.TP
\fB\-\-filters\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Structured search filters as JSON
.TP
\fB\-\-graph\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Explicit graph IRI for this operation
.TP
\fB\-\-graphs\fR \fI<VALUE>\fR
Explicit graph selection for search
.TP
\fB\-\-explain\fR
Include search ranking explanations
.TP
\fB\-\-all\-graphs\fR
Search all permitted graphs explicitly
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIquery\fR>

